{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_05_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_05","title":"8:31P.M.","storyCode":"CB-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"92cec988dfab90203fee7701199628ccb6a186f90c60aca8b35d088aa56a5a81","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"8:52 P.M.  天氣/多雲\n龍門貧民窟"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖！想活命就告訴我們，鼠王到底在哪兒！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不知道啊！什麼鼠王......真的沒聽說過啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敬酒不吃吃罰酒——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，卡彭先生說過不要隨便對平民動手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這種下三濫的貨色能算市民嗎？遮遮掩掩的，說不定就是個感染者垃圾！還敢裝糊塗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等！別打了！我真的不知道啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘴硬！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔——呃，嘔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，別管這傢伙了，噁心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看名單，下一個老東西似乎就住在這裡不遠，是個賣魚丸的，就在生鮮賣場對面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，浪費時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕，哈啊——骨頭都斷了，這幫——該死的——下手真重，嘎哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"必須得......告訴他們......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊的，站住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，注意旁邊那個男的，我總覺得這傢伙不好惹。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（龍門當地的幫派？不用擔心，按照卡彭先生的報告，都是小角色。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我有點事情要問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"誰也不想惹上麻煩，對吧？乖乖回答我們，我們就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的拳頭上有血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，只是些不配合的垃圾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"但是像你們這樣的好市民，當然會配合我們的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"這是威脅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"大家心裡清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"那我拒絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......拒絕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你好像弄錯了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你也想變成那邊巷子裡的垃圾，被打得半死不活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"槐琥，我剛才聽到的慘叫聲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"——你們剛才說了，“垃圾”，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"以防萬一我多問一句，你是指這裡的居民嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒那麼多時間陪你廢話，趕緊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"敢、敢還手！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"都給我上——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"下一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"不，算了，反正你們也就只是一群不入流的嘍囉，一起上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"古往今來，邪不勝正，你們這些濫傷無辜的下九流，何足掛齒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼情況！？這女人的動作——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那就嘗嘗弩彈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......慢著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咕！鬆手！你這混帳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你這種人，屬於冰箱斷電餿了三天的海膽，差不多那個感覺吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，我不該學槐琥咬文嚼字的，還是直接點好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好大的勁，等！等等！要斷了！要斷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"把武器放下，滾出這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我知道了，你先放手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......但果然還是應該弄脫臼比較好吧。畢竟你拿著那麼危險的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！你，你真下的了手——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這兩個人怎麼回事？我沒聽說這附近有什麼注意目標啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，先走，回頭再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你們是哪個幫派的，都不會有好下場的！該死的龍門人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"不，都說了我不是黑社會，為什麼都喜歡以貌取人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"先別管這些，救人要緊，我去那邊看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"——別動，我來幫你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿孑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，都是皮外傷，別急，我這就去叫醫生，他們離這不遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿孑！別管我，先去找你董阿伯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們下一個目標就是他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","aliases":["槐琥"]},{"speakerId":"char_272_strong","aliases":["孑"]}]}
